Marmoset brain MRI (50 µm), DICOM slices 001.dcm - 480.dcm in this folder

Attribution:
  Data by Cirong Liu / Marmoset Brain Mapping
  https://www.scidb.cn/en/file?fid=6444dd2f292d4e32b96ea092&mode=front

License:
  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Changes made to the original data:
  - converted from NIfTI to DICOM (no spatial resampling)
  - signal values scaled x1,000,000 (arbitrary MRI intensity units, stored as 16-bit integers)
  - 3D reconstruction and rendering in this application

Terms in short (the license text at the link above is the only binding text):
  - Non-commercial use only.
  - Adapted versions (for example segmentations made from this data) must be shared under the same license, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
  - This license applies to the data in this folder only, not to the rest of this application.

